1
00:00:18,852 --> 00:00:20,895
‎This is such a precious thing.

2
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:23,398
‎-Are you really giving it to me?
‎-Yes.

3
00:00:25,817 --> 00:00:27,026
‎Let him be.

4
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:28,820
‎He is simply delighted.

5
00:00:32,782 --> 00:00:33,616
‎Cousin Yun.

6
00:00:34,409 --> 00:00:37,495
‎Have you ever seen the map
‎drawn by the Italian, Matteo Ricci?

7
00:00:38,621 --> 00:00:42,250
‎It took me quite some time
‎to find Joseon upon it.

8
00:00:43,334 --> 00:00:45,712
‎Joseon, which had always seemed
‎so vast and unmistakable,

9
00:00:45,795 --> 00:00:47,422
‎suddenly felt so small.

10
00:00:48,423 --> 00:00:50,383
‎It filled me with a sudden fear.

11
00:00:51,551 --> 00:00:54,304
‎How small must I be,

12
00:00:54,387 --> 00:00:56,389
‎living in one corner of Hwaseong?

13
00:01:13,156 --> 00:01:14,240
‎A letter!

14
00:01:15,283 --> 00:01:16,284
‎Over here!

15
00:01:16,367 --> 00:01:18,578
‎It is for the young lady
‎of Vice Minister Cho's house!

16
00:01:18,661 --> 00:01:19,496
‎Yes.

17
00:01:20,121 --> 00:01:21,748
‎I unfolded the map

18
00:01:21,831 --> 00:01:24,250
‎drawn in Joseon centuries ago.

19
00:01:25,418 --> 00:01:27,337
‎By the standards of Western learning,

20
00:01:27,879 --> 00:01:30,590
‎the size of Joseon upon it
‎is plainly wrong.

21
00:01:31,925 --> 00:01:35,261
‎And yet, I found myself wondering,

22
00:01:35,345 --> 00:01:36,888
‎"Is it truly wrong?"

23
00:01:37,764 --> 00:01:39,974
‎Perhaps they merely wished to capture

24
00:01:40,058 --> 00:01:42,393
‎the hearts of those
‎who stood upon this small land.

25
00:01:43,812 --> 00:01:46,606
‎And so, through the two different Joseons
‎drawn upon these maps,

26
00:01:46,689 --> 00:01:47,982
‎I came to realize something.

27
00:01:49,108 --> 00:01:51,236
‎Whether it be large or small,

28
00:01:51,903 --> 00:01:53,738
‎we see the world through our own eyes,

29
00:01:53,822 --> 00:01:56,825
‎and they through theirs.

30
00:01:58,785 --> 00:02:02,831
‎Just as I am simply me,
‎and you are simply you.

31
00:02:05,542 --> 00:02:06,417
‎What do you think?

32
00:02:07,502 --> 00:02:09,129
‎You may call it sophistry,

33
00:02:09,838 --> 00:02:13,758
‎yet I am most curious to hear what you,
‎my literary friend, make of it.

34
00:02:14,884 --> 00:02:16,219
‎I shall await your reply.

35
00:02:23,184 --> 00:02:25,937
‎Keep your blade firm. Straight and strong.

36
00:02:26,604 --> 00:02:28,690
‎Uphold the way of a gentleman.

37
00:02:28,773 --> 00:02:29,774
‎Do you understand?

38
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:49,794
‎Straight

39
00:02:51,421 --> 00:02:52,297
‎and strong.

40
00:02:53,131 --> 00:02:54,090
‎Straight

41
00:02:54,883 --> 00:02:55,800
‎and strong.

42
00:02:56,467 --> 00:02:57,302
‎Strong.

43
00:02:59,679 --> 00:03:01,598
‎I lost my father so suddenly,

44
00:03:02,432 --> 00:03:04,976
‎and there is no stopping
‎this grief that rises within me.

45
00:03:06,895 --> 00:03:08,521
‎I need my father.

46
00:03:10,106 --> 00:03:13,359
‎I wished to become
‎the sort of son he would be proud of,

47
00:03:14,402 --> 00:03:15,570
‎but now it is too late.

48
00:03:16,571 --> 00:03:17,405
‎Cousin Yun.

49
00:03:18,364 --> 00:03:19,908
‎What am I to do?

50
00:03:21,659 --> 00:03:24,954
‎I am only sorry
‎that I cannot fully fathom your pain.

51
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:27,040
‎But Won,

52
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:31,669
‎the person Uncle wished you to become
‎is not the only true answer.

53
00:03:32,545 --> 00:03:34,380
‎I felt I had to tell you that myself.

54
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,967
‎Rather than chasing after
‎another's footsteps,

55
00:03:38,051 --> 00:03:39,802
‎you must find yourself.

56
00:03:40,887 --> 00:03:44,057
‎Though my words
‎may not reach your heart just yet.

57
00:03:46,267 --> 00:03:47,685
‎"I am me,

58
00:03:49,103 --> 00:03:50,146
‎and you are you."

59
00:03:57,820 --> 00:04:02,325
‎THE SCANDAL

60
00:04:09,999 --> 00:04:11,834
‎How indecent.

61
00:04:17,924 --> 00:04:18,800
‎Madam.

62
00:04:19,342 --> 00:04:23,429
‎Lady Cho, the wife of Minister Yoo,
‎is here to see you.

63
00:04:26,057 --> 00:04:27,475
‎Send her in.

64
00:04:31,104 --> 00:04:33,106
‎Though it bears no dye,

65
00:04:33,731 --> 00:04:35,483
‎it shines so splendidly.

66
00:04:36,276 --> 00:04:39,946
‎I must say, this silk resembles you.

67
00:04:40,989 --> 00:04:43,658
‎The tobacco you sent last night
‎was more than enough,

68
00:04:44,450 --> 00:04:46,160
‎yet you bring this as well.

69
00:04:47,203 --> 00:04:48,746
‎Thank you.

70
00:04:51,499 --> 00:04:53,668
‎I shall treasure it.

71
00:04:54,294 --> 00:04:56,045
‎You are too gracious.

72
00:04:57,005 --> 00:04:59,048
‎I am deeply humbled by your words.

73
00:04:59,674 --> 00:05:03,469
‎Though truthfully,
‎I could not sleep all night for fear

74
00:05:03,553 --> 00:05:06,597
‎you may have been displeased
‎by my cousin's misconduct.

75
00:05:06,681 --> 00:05:07,682
‎Just as I thought.

76
00:05:09,058 --> 00:05:12,729
‎Even between cousins,
‎it could not have been an easy decision.

77
00:05:14,105 --> 00:05:16,733
‎Since you are a lady
‎who knows propriety and decorum,

78
00:05:16,816 --> 00:05:18,985
‎you chose the late hour to inform me,

79
00:05:19,610 --> 00:05:21,446
‎the Left State Councilor,

80
00:05:22,196 --> 00:05:24,657
‎and our In-ho quietly of the matter.

81
00:05:25,325 --> 00:05:26,367
‎Especially

82
00:05:27,285 --> 00:05:29,787
‎with a widowed daughter-in-law
‎in this household.

83
00:05:31,664 --> 00:05:33,041
‎Thank you, Lady Cho.

84
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:34,876
‎Thanks to you,

85
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:40,048
‎I summoned In-ho
‎at the crack of dawn and firmly warned him

86
00:05:41,215 --> 00:05:43,051
‎not to trouble your cousin further.

87
00:05:44,218 --> 00:05:47,138
‎One's studies ought to be pursued
‎by one's own efforts.

88
00:05:47,221 --> 00:05:48,931
‎Hearing you say so

89
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:51,976
‎finally puts my mind at ease, however…

90
00:05:56,105 --> 00:05:57,148
‎What's the matter?

91
00:06:02,737 --> 00:06:07,158
‎I wish to believe your daughter-in-law
‎shall handle the matter wisely,

92
00:06:07,241 --> 00:06:10,286
‎but I must regretfully say my cousin

93
00:06:11,370 --> 00:06:13,581
‎is no ordinary man.

94
00:06:14,165 --> 00:06:15,500
‎I know.

95
00:06:15,583 --> 00:06:17,376
‎I know that very well indeed.

96
00:06:19,003 --> 00:06:23,466
‎With a face so excessively handsome,

97
00:06:23,549 --> 00:06:25,885
‎how could anyone fail to suspect as much?

98
00:06:28,930 --> 00:06:30,681
‎Which is why I say this.

99
00:06:32,517 --> 00:06:35,978
‎In the end,
‎they are but a young man and woman.

100
00:06:37,522 --> 00:06:41,567
‎Even two shadows lose their boundaries
‎beneath the lamplight.

101
00:06:43,194 --> 00:06:44,654
‎Would it not be safer

102
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:48,116
‎to keep them apart,
‎even by force if necessary,

103
00:06:48,199 --> 00:06:50,076
‎so they never cross paths?

104
00:06:56,749 --> 00:06:58,918
‎Forgive me. That was presumptuous of me.

105
00:07:16,769 --> 00:07:17,728
‎Come now!

106
00:07:21,691 --> 00:07:23,609
‎There is no need for that.

107
00:07:26,988 --> 00:07:29,615
‎You embarrass me by doing so.

108
00:07:30,616 --> 00:07:31,492
‎Goodness.

109
00:07:32,118 --> 00:07:35,746
‎If my husband learned of this,
‎I should never hear the end of it.

110
00:07:35,830 --> 00:07:37,999
‎Raise your head.

111
00:07:38,082 --> 00:07:39,375
‎Come now.

112
00:07:44,797 --> 00:07:46,716
‎Right, that reminds me.

113
00:07:47,550 --> 00:07:49,802
‎How fares Minister Yoo these days?

114
00:07:50,386 --> 00:07:53,264
‎He merely awaits a summons

115
00:07:54,015 --> 00:07:55,600
‎from the Left State Councilor.

116
00:08:14,243 --> 00:08:15,953
‎My lady!

117
00:08:19,165 --> 00:08:19,999
‎My lady.

118
00:08:22,251 --> 00:08:23,127
‎My lady.

119
00:08:25,630 --> 00:08:28,216
‎The Left State Councilor has invited me

120
00:08:29,217 --> 00:08:30,760
‎to the gathering of the ministers.

121
00:08:32,136 --> 00:08:33,804
‎Do you know how long it has been?

122
00:08:35,848 --> 00:08:36,807
‎My lord.

123
00:08:37,308 --> 00:08:41,395
‎It would seem the Left State Councilor
‎has not forgotten your capabilities.

124
00:08:42,605 --> 00:08:44,315
‎It is all thanks to you.

125
00:08:45,733 --> 00:08:47,360
‎You have paid your respects

126
00:08:47,443 --> 00:08:49,529
‎to the Lady of the First Rank
‎almost every day.

127
00:08:49,612 --> 00:08:50,988
‎I am well aware of it.

128
00:08:51,072 --> 00:08:53,866
‎How could that possibly be my doing?

129
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:56,077
‎My lady.

130
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:08,297
‎My lady.

131
00:09:10,258 --> 00:09:11,133
‎Well…

132
00:09:12,885 --> 00:09:13,719
‎In truth,

133
00:09:15,346 --> 00:09:17,139
‎I know as well.

134
00:09:18,391 --> 00:09:20,685
‎That the lack of an heir in this house

135
00:09:21,769 --> 00:09:23,688
‎is entirely because of me.

136
00:09:24,855 --> 00:09:26,649
‎Though I knew it to be futile,

137
00:09:27,650 --> 00:09:29,110
‎I still brought in a concubine.

138
00:09:31,571 --> 00:09:35,116
‎Yet I fear I may fail
‎to fulfill your wish nonetheless.

139
00:09:35,658 --> 00:09:39,453
‎All the while, you have done nothing
‎but strive for my sake.

140
00:09:43,207 --> 00:09:45,793
‎My lord, you must not say such things.

141
00:09:47,420 --> 00:09:49,839
‎So-ok shall prove it.

142
00:09:51,007 --> 00:09:55,428
‎You shall most certainly have an heir.

143
00:09:58,556 --> 00:09:59,390
‎My lady.

144
00:10:09,275 --> 00:10:12,278
‎Yes. If you say so, then so it shall be.

145
00:10:13,279 --> 00:10:15,239
‎I shall prove yet

146
00:10:15,865 --> 00:10:17,867
‎that I am still a vigorous man!

147
00:10:18,618 --> 00:10:22,246
‎-You will hurt yourself! Put me down!
‎-I am not so frail yet!

148
00:10:29,795 --> 00:10:31,505
‎-My lady.
‎-Please put me down now.

149
00:11:05,790 --> 00:11:06,707
‎Mind your step.

150
00:11:15,549 --> 00:11:16,759
‎Forgive me.

151
00:11:17,343 --> 00:11:18,344
‎No, wait…

152
00:11:22,264 --> 00:11:23,182
‎You…

153
00:11:23,891 --> 00:11:24,767
‎Yes?

154
00:11:29,688 --> 00:11:31,190
‎Where are you going?

155
00:11:32,817 --> 00:11:33,776
‎Nowhere.

156
00:11:33,859 --> 00:11:35,611
‎I merely stepped out

157
00:11:35,694 --> 00:11:37,988
‎because they said
‎the moon was lovely tonight.

158
00:11:44,412 --> 00:11:45,329
‎And who was it

159
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:50,084
‎you meant to meet
‎on such a lovely moonlit night?

160
00:11:50,167 --> 00:11:51,836
‎-No, it is not that--
‎-Hush!

161
00:11:54,130 --> 00:11:55,131
‎And still you persist?

162
00:11:57,091 --> 00:11:59,927
‎Young Master In-ho.

163
00:12:25,453 --> 00:12:28,122
‎This is a rough sketch
‎based on what I saw in a book.

164
00:12:28,747 --> 00:12:29,874
‎It is an alarm clock.

165
00:12:31,292 --> 00:12:33,961
‎A thing that lets one see the time.

166
00:12:34,462 --> 00:12:37,131
‎This would be about
‎a quarter of an hour past 9 p.m.

167
00:12:37,673 --> 00:12:39,884
‎The single drumbeat earlier
‎signaled 7 p.m.,

168
00:12:40,551 --> 00:12:42,011
‎so it should be about here.

169
00:12:42,094 --> 00:12:42,970
‎Before long,

170
00:12:44,096 --> 00:12:45,306
‎the 9 p.m. drum will sound.

171
00:12:48,893 --> 00:12:51,937
‎I shall be listening from here as well,
‎but I must not miss it.

172
00:12:52,521 --> 00:12:55,649
‎Go stand outside the gate,
‎and when you hear the drum strike twice,

173
00:12:55,733 --> 00:12:57,109
‎come tell me at once.

174
00:12:57,860 --> 00:12:58,694
‎Yes, sir.

175
00:12:59,570 --> 00:13:00,988
‎Two drumbeats.

176
00:13:01,572 --> 00:13:02,573
‎My lord!

177
00:13:02,656 --> 00:13:04,492
‎So you meant to meet

178
00:13:05,868 --> 00:13:08,621
‎when these hands
‎stretched straight across?

179
00:13:09,246 --> 00:13:10,247
‎Yes.

180
00:13:10,331 --> 00:13:13,125
‎I am so dumbfounded
‎I scarcely know what to say.

181
00:13:13,209 --> 00:13:15,044
‎Forgive me, my lord!

182
00:13:15,127 --> 00:13:16,545
‎Let me explain.

183
00:13:22,885 --> 00:13:24,345
‎It is only proper

184
00:13:25,679 --> 00:13:29,558
‎that I tell my cousin
‎and my brother-in-law of this matter.

185
00:13:30,601 --> 00:13:32,186
‎Yet if I uphold propriety,

186
00:13:32,853 --> 00:13:35,022
‎I betray my loyalty to Young Master In-ho.

187
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:39,860
‎And if I keep faith with him,
‎I stray from propriety.

188
00:13:40,736 --> 00:13:42,613
‎Huh? Hold a moment.

189
00:13:43,781 --> 00:13:45,157
‎Why did you come out so early?

190
00:13:47,451 --> 00:13:48,285
‎Pardon?

191
00:13:54,583 --> 00:13:57,378
‎I happen to know how alarm clocks work.

192
00:13:57,461 --> 00:13:58,712
‎For these hands

193
00:13:58,796 --> 00:14:02,716
‎to stretch straight across like this,
‎there is still quite some time left.

194
00:14:06,554 --> 00:14:07,846
‎But I could swear earlier…

195
00:14:08,973 --> 00:14:10,766
‎You do not even know how to read it?

196
00:14:11,517 --> 00:14:13,477
‎No, I do know how.

197
00:14:15,312 --> 00:14:16,647
‎You most certainly do not.

198
00:14:18,357 --> 00:14:19,483
‎I tell you, I do…

199
00:14:21,068 --> 00:14:23,237
‎But today,

200
00:14:24,446 --> 00:14:27,491
‎my mind is troubled
‎by rather distressing matters.

201
00:14:29,201 --> 00:14:30,578
‎So I shall pretend

202
00:14:32,079 --> 00:14:33,414
‎I saw nothing of your affair.

203
00:14:38,294 --> 00:14:39,545
‎Will you, really?

204
00:14:39,628 --> 00:14:40,462
‎In return,

205
00:14:41,130 --> 00:14:43,132
‎do not wander about and invite trouble.

206
00:14:43,757 --> 00:14:45,009
‎Until the appointed hour,

207
00:14:45,759 --> 00:14:49,263
‎stay shut away in your room
‎and read ‎Elementary Learning‎ aloud.

208
00:14:49,346 --> 00:14:52,099
‎I shall be outside listening for it.

209
00:14:54,894 --> 00:14:56,520
‎Elementary Learning‎?

210
00:14:56,604 --> 00:14:58,022
‎Do you not know of it?

211
00:14:58,606 --> 00:15:00,232
‎No, I know it.

212
00:15:00,316 --> 00:15:01,859
‎I do, but…

213
00:15:01,942 --> 00:15:02,860
‎But what?

214
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,820
‎Well…

215
00:15:04,904 --> 00:15:06,405
‎I shall go to my cousin…

216
00:15:06,906 --> 00:15:08,449
‎I am going.

217
00:15:08,532 --> 00:15:09,700
‎I am going, my lord.

218
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:18,667
‎Young Master In-ho? Now hold a moment.

219
00:15:19,501 --> 00:15:23,088
‎That means In-ho and So-ok…

220
00:15:24,256 --> 00:15:25,716
‎Good grief.

221
00:15:26,842 --> 00:15:27,927
‎What a complete mess.

222
00:15:42,232 --> 00:15:44,318
‎Young Master, it is 9 p.m.

223
00:16:14,348 --> 00:16:18,811
‎"Once a girl reaches the age of 10,
‎she must not venture outside."

224
00:16:18,894 --> 00:16:23,107
‎"She must meekly heed the teachings
‎of her mother and teacher,

225
00:16:23,190 --> 00:16:25,651
‎tend hemp and ramie…

226
00:16:31,407 --> 00:16:33,909
‎raise silkworms, reel silk,

227
00:16:33,993 --> 00:16:37,162
‎weave silk, and braid silk sashes…"

228
00:16:50,009 --> 00:16:51,510
‎I was reading it! I was!

229
00:17:00,060 --> 00:17:01,729
‎Young Master…

230
00:17:17,911 --> 00:17:18,746
‎What?

231
00:17:25,252 --> 00:17:26,211
‎Oh, surely not.

232
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:29,715
‎Did he really leave
‎just because I was a little bit late?

233
00:17:47,316 --> 00:17:48,317
‎Miss…

234
00:17:55,449 --> 00:17:57,326
‎Why were you not there last night?

235
00:17:57,409 --> 00:17:58,243
‎Pardon?

236
00:17:59,411 --> 00:18:00,245
‎No, I…

237
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:03,332
‎I most certainly was there.

238
00:18:03,415 --> 00:18:04,416
‎Of course you were.

239
00:18:05,334 --> 00:18:07,002
‎You could not wait even a moment.

240
00:18:09,463 --> 00:18:12,299
‎Very well. The fault was entirely mine.

241
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:15,427
‎I have committed
‎a most unforgivable offense!

242
00:18:15,511 --> 00:18:18,305
‎No, I did not mean it was your fault.

243
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:21,350
‎You thought

244
00:18:22,434 --> 00:18:24,728
‎you could simply disregard a girl like me.

245
00:18:25,354 --> 00:18:27,523
‎Disregard? That is ridiculous.

246
00:18:27,606 --> 00:18:29,525
‎-It is completely untrue.
‎-No, it is not!

247
00:18:30,150 --> 00:18:32,653
‎You look down on me
‎because I am but a concubine!

248
00:18:44,123 --> 00:18:46,667
‎What do you mean, a concubine?

249
00:18:48,293 --> 00:18:49,128
‎Pardon?

250
00:19:29,084 --> 00:19:30,878
‎-My lord.
‎-Yes.

251
00:19:51,940 --> 00:19:55,527
‎His Majesty summoned me
‎on a matter of great importance.

252
00:19:57,362 --> 00:20:00,699
‎On my way back from the palace,
‎I bought this for you.

253
00:20:01,408 --> 00:20:03,285
‎Oh, it is ‎yakgwa‎.

254
00:20:04,369 --> 00:20:06,330
‎Thank you, my lord.

255
00:20:06,955 --> 00:20:07,789
‎Of course.

256
00:20:13,170 --> 00:20:14,463
‎-Say, "ah."
‎-"Ah."

257
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:25,557
‎Now,

258
00:20:25,641 --> 00:20:29,478
‎I must leave Bukchon for a short while.

259
00:20:29,561 --> 00:20:30,437
‎Pardon?

260
00:20:30,979 --> 00:20:32,648
‎It should not take long.

261
00:20:33,273 --> 00:20:34,399
‎So while I am away,

262
00:20:34,483 --> 00:20:38,278
‎learn well the proper conduct of a lady
‎under my lady's guidance.

263
00:20:40,614 --> 00:20:41,865
‎Once I return,

264
00:20:42,741 --> 00:20:45,202
‎I shall make you my concubine at once.
‎Do you understand?

265
00:20:45,702 --> 00:20:46,620
‎Really?

266
00:20:46,703 --> 00:20:47,746
‎Yes.

267
00:20:48,372 --> 00:20:50,374
‎Thank you, my lord.

268
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:01,426
‎This wretched hat…

269
00:21:10,852 --> 00:21:14,147
‎His Majesty is holding Lady Hyegyeong's
‎60th birthday banquet in Hwaseong,

270
00:21:15,274 --> 00:21:16,942
‎and the matter has been entrusted to me.

271
00:21:18,860 --> 00:21:20,779
‎I shall show you without fail.

272
00:21:20,862 --> 00:21:22,698
‎That I can firmly uphold the position

273
00:21:23,949 --> 00:21:25,742
‎you have restored to me.

274
00:21:35,544 --> 00:21:36,420
‎Dear cousin.

275
00:21:37,379 --> 00:21:39,214
‎While your brother-in-law is away,

276
00:21:39,298 --> 00:21:42,175
‎why not stay here for a time?

277
00:21:42,259 --> 00:21:44,803
‎I imagine there is much you wish to ask.

278
00:21:47,514 --> 00:21:50,434
‎What did the widow say?

279
00:21:51,768 --> 00:21:53,770
‎How should I know?

280
00:21:54,271 --> 00:21:56,648
‎Since sending that filthy letter,

281
00:21:57,232 --> 00:22:00,694
‎I have not seen
‎so much as the hem of her skirt.

282
00:22:01,862 --> 00:22:02,696
‎Then again,

283
00:22:03,697 --> 00:22:06,783
‎who could possibly know
‎the state of her heart now?

284
00:22:08,535 --> 00:22:11,496
‎I only hope she has not altogether
‎lost her senses.

285
00:22:13,498 --> 00:22:14,374
‎Well,

286
00:22:15,083 --> 00:22:16,209
‎who knows?

287
00:22:16,835 --> 00:22:18,545
‎She may have lost her senses so completely

288
00:22:19,254 --> 00:22:21,590
‎that she secretly indulges in that letter.

289
00:22:42,819 --> 00:22:45,072
‎I must become a refined woman now.

290
00:22:46,323 --> 00:22:49,409
‎My So-ok has become a lady of Bukchon,

291
00:22:49,493 --> 00:22:51,119
‎so I too must rise to the occasion.

292
00:22:51,203 --> 00:22:52,245
‎Oh, my goodness.

293
00:22:52,829 --> 00:22:55,207
‎You are more innocent than I thought.

294
00:22:55,290 --> 00:22:59,461
‎If you knew how the ladies of Bukchon
‎truly amuse themselves,

295
00:22:59,544 --> 00:23:00,712
‎you would faint away.

296
00:23:00,796 --> 00:23:02,255
‎What does that matter?

297
00:23:02,339 --> 00:23:03,381
‎Have you heard?

298
00:23:03,924 --> 00:23:06,218
‎Choi was cast out
‎of the Chief State Councilor's house.

299
00:23:06,301 --> 00:23:09,513
‎I heard the councilor warned him
‎never to set foot in Bukchon again.

300
00:23:10,472 --> 00:23:12,265
‎What on earth did he do?

301
00:23:12,349 --> 00:23:13,934
‎The youngest son of that house

302
00:23:15,644 --> 00:23:17,562
‎turned out to be left-handed.

303
00:23:17,646 --> 00:23:20,148
‎Just like Choi.

304
00:23:20,857 --> 00:23:22,734
‎It was his seed, then?

305
00:23:23,276 --> 00:23:25,362
‎My, my.

306
00:23:25,445 --> 00:23:28,490
‎What sort of place is Bukchon

307
00:23:28,573 --> 00:23:30,951
‎that such amusing scandals
‎break out every day?

308
00:23:34,287 --> 00:23:37,457
‎Madam, Lord Cho Won is here.

309
00:23:37,541 --> 00:23:38,917
‎Yes, send him in…

310
00:23:39,543 --> 00:23:40,710
‎What?

311
00:23:40,794 --> 00:23:42,921
‎What… What did you say?

312
00:23:51,888 --> 00:23:52,722
‎My lord.

313
00:23:54,015 --> 00:23:57,644
‎It seems the tobacco
‎I let you sample pleased you after all.

314
00:23:58,603 --> 00:24:01,022
‎I could not forget the taste,
‎so I came for more.

315
00:24:02,774 --> 00:24:05,819
‎Yet amidst the fragrance of flowers
‎in full bloom here,

316
00:24:08,989 --> 00:24:11,783
‎I can hardly recall the scent
‎of the tobacco I meant to buy.

317
00:24:13,076 --> 00:24:13,952
‎Oh, my.

318
00:24:15,078 --> 00:24:16,204
‎Off with you now.

319
00:24:17,330 --> 00:24:19,082
‎I must attend to my esteemed guest.

320
00:24:22,210 --> 00:24:23,545
‎Bun-hui.

321
00:24:27,841 --> 00:24:29,801
‎Go on now. Quickly.

322
00:24:53,783 --> 00:24:56,244
‎It has been so long
‎since I sent that letter.

323
00:24:56,328 --> 00:24:58,455
‎When you did not come to see me,

324
00:24:59,706 --> 00:25:02,125
‎I thought my heart would break.

325
00:25:04,669 --> 00:25:07,214
‎So that is why you dared send
‎such an audacious letter

326
00:25:07,964 --> 00:25:09,674
‎without a shred of fear.

327
00:25:17,390 --> 00:25:20,769
‎Did you not once say you liked me
‎because I feared nothing?

328
00:25:20,852 --> 00:25:24,606
‎That is how I came to be held
‎so tightly in your arms.

329
00:25:25,106 --> 00:25:26,524
‎And in the end,

330
00:25:27,317 --> 00:25:30,445
‎was it not that very letter
‎that brought you back to me now?

331
00:25:35,867 --> 00:25:36,868
‎You…

332
00:25:38,370 --> 00:25:42,040
‎You do not realize what you are scribbling
‎with that reckless brush of yours,

333
00:25:43,041 --> 00:25:44,334
‎or how greatly

334
00:25:45,377 --> 00:25:47,671
‎that scrap of paper might trouble me.

335
00:25:47,754 --> 00:25:49,714
‎You never pause to think of such things.

336
00:25:55,804 --> 00:25:56,638
‎Bun-hui.

337
00:25:59,349 --> 00:26:00,725
‎It is

338
00:26:00,809 --> 00:26:04,312
‎that long, wet tongue of yours
‎that always worries me.

339
00:26:09,317 --> 00:26:12,195
‎Wag it carelessly, and it may well
‎tighten the noose around your own neck.

340
00:26:13,697 --> 00:26:14,614
‎And yet

341
00:26:15,782 --> 00:26:19,619
‎all you care for
‎is indulging yourself in the thrill of it.

342
00:26:24,582 --> 00:26:28,086
‎You speak as though
‎your very life hung upon my little letter.

343
00:26:34,217 --> 00:26:35,677
‎Bun-hui.

344
00:26:36,720 --> 00:26:38,763
‎If you care at all for your daughter,

345
00:26:40,307 --> 00:26:43,143
‎then from now on
‎you must at least feign modesty.

346
00:26:46,438 --> 00:26:48,231
‎Only then may you peek over the walls

347
00:26:48,315 --> 00:26:50,525
‎of the scholar-official households
‎you so admire.

348
00:26:51,234 --> 00:26:52,777
‎And only then may you set foot

349
00:26:53,695 --> 00:26:56,573
‎in the gatherings
‎of those noblewomen you envy so dearly.

350
00:27:04,581 --> 00:27:08,084
‎If you wish to enter Bukchon,

351
00:27:11,963 --> 00:27:13,381
‎you must pretend

352
00:27:14,674 --> 00:27:16,301
‎not to hear what you hear,

353
00:27:19,179 --> 00:27:20,513
‎and not to see what you see.

354
00:27:38,239 --> 00:27:39,532
‎Keep that in mind, Bun-hui.

355
00:27:58,176 --> 00:28:00,553
‎My lord! Forgive me.

356
00:28:01,513 --> 00:28:02,806
‎Forgive me.

357
00:28:02,889 --> 00:28:04,808
‎My mother is poor with the brush,

358
00:28:04,891 --> 00:28:06,851
‎so I always copy her letters in the end.

359
00:28:06,935 --> 00:28:09,771
‎If the letter displeased you,
‎I apologize in her stead.

360
00:28:10,939 --> 00:28:13,441
‎This matter
‎shall never pass beyond these walls

361
00:28:13,525 --> 00:28:15,652
‎for as long as I live.

362
00:28:15,735 --> 00:28:17,487
‎I swear it to you, my lord.

363
00:28:19,447 --> 00:28:20,323
‎Your mother…

364
00:28:22,659 --> 00:28:26,913
‎had you, her own daughter,
‎copy such a letter for her?

365
00:28:32,544 --> 00:28:34,087
‎She is not my birth mother.

366
00:28:34,921 --> 00:28:38,258
‎She still stands in my mother's place,
‎so I had no choice but to copy it.

367
00:28:38,341 --> 00:28:41,428
‎But that woman is so filthy
‎I wish I had nothing to do with her.

368
00:28:58,820 --> 00:28:59,946
‎Your mother

369
00:29:00,905 --> 00:29:03,366
‎seems to know paintings rather well.

370
00:29:04,075 --> 00:29:05,702
‎Do you have an eye for them as well?

371
00:29:05,785 --> 00:29:06,619
‎Pardon?

372
00:29:08,371 --> 00:29:10,457
‎I know little of what is fine or poor.

373
00:29:10,540 --> 00:29:12,917
‎I only know what fetches a price.

374
00:29:14,627 --> 00:29:15,545
‎Is that so?

375
00:29:16,796 --> 00:29:19,716
‎Then what do you think of this painting?

376
00:29:20,675 --> 00:29:22,427
‎Would it fetch a handsome sum?

377
00:29:25,096 --> 00:29:28,183
‎The peonies seem to be swaying
‎in the spring breeze,

378
00:29:28,266 --> 00:29:31,478
‎so lifelike that their fragrance
‎seems to rise from them.

379
00:29:33,062 --> 00:29:36,441
‎And this little bud hidden behind the leaf

380
00:29:36,524 --> 00:29:40,445
‎is so charming,
‎it makes one wish to tap it with a finger.

381
00:29:43,531 --> 00:29:46,826
‎My lord has long been away from court,
‎and the affair entrusted to him

382
00:29:46,910 --> 00:29:48,745
‎is of the utmost importance.

383
00:30:00,882 --> 00:30:01,758
‎Here.

384
00:30:02,300 --> 00:30:04,260
‎If you and I were to finish

385
00:30:04,344 --> 00:30:07,639
‎this peony painting together
‎and present it to him upon his return,

386
00:30:07,722 --> 00:30:10,350
‎it would be
‎a most wonderful act of devotion.

387
00:30:12,811 --> 00:30:16,105
‎Your handwriting was so firm and elegant

388
00:30:16,189 --> 00:30:18,191
‎that I greatly admired it.

389
00:30:18,775 --> 00:30:21,820
‎Fill it with your writing.
‎Anything you wish.

390
00:30:48,847 --> 00:30:53,935
‎THE PEONIES IN FULL BLOSSOM…

391
00:31:01,192 --> 00:31:04,237
‎THE PEONIES IN FULL BLOSSOM,
‎HOW COULD THEY BE…

392
00:31:06,447 --> 00:31:08,533
‎This handwriting feels different.

393
00:31:09,868 --> 00:31:12,203
‎Quite unlike the one you used
‎for ‎Elementary Learning‎.

394
00:31:12,829 --> 00:31:15,623
‎To think you could instantly fashion
‎an entirely new style

395
00:31:16,124 --> 00:31:18,501
‎so well suited to this peony painting.

396
00:31:19,878 --> 00:31:23,256
‎It seems I have brought
‎quite a remarkable lady into my household.

397
00:31:33,349 --> 00:31:34,851
‎I deserve to die!

398
00:31:35,435 --> 00:31:37,103
‎Please have mercy on me, my lady!

399
00:31:38,438 --> 00:31:42,025
‎In truth, it was not I who wrote it.

400
00:31:42,108 --> 00:31:44,110
‎Young Master In-ho wrote it for me.

401
00:31:47,071 --> 00:31:50,825
‎You mean Young Master Kwon In-ho
‎of the Left State Councilor's house?

402
00:31:50,909 --> 00:31:52,493
‎Please spare me… No.

403
00:31:53,119 --> 00:31:55,580
‎Just kill me instead.
‎How dare a mere concubine…

404
00:31:59,500 --> 00:32:02,378
‎But it is all over now.

405
00:32:03,630 --> 00:32:06,758
‎The young master
‎already learned that I am a concubine,

406
00:32:06,841 --> 00:32:07,717
‎so…

407
00:32:08,509 --> 00:32:09,636
‎So…

408
00:32:17,018 --> 00:32:18,311
‎Poor thing.

409
00:32:19,854 --> 00:32:23,399
‎Your heart must have been heavy,
‎preparing to give yourself to my lord

410
00:32:23,900 --> 00:32:26,110
‎while carrying feelings for another.

411
00:32:32,075 --> 00:32:33,201
‎My lady.

412
00:32:33,284 --> 00:32:35,036
‎And after learning who you were,

413
00:32:35,119 --> 00:32:37,372
‎did Young Master In-ho
‎pretend not to know you?

414
00:32:37,455 --> 00:32:41,209
‎I have not seen him since.

415
00:32:48,883 --> 00:32:53,471
‎I fear your heart, delicate as a flower,
‎may have been wounded.

416
00:32:58,309 --> 00:33:02,897
‎As long as you do not neglect
‎your duty in serving my lord,

417
00:33:03,898 --> 00:33:06,192
‎I can overlook such a matter.

418
00:33:08,778 --> 00:33:11,948
‎I know well enough how harsh life can be

419
00:33:12,448 --> 00:33:13,950
‎for a woman in Bukchon.

420
00:33:15,994 --> 00:33:17,161
‎My lady.

421
00:33:17,996 --> 00:33:22,667
‎But surely no one else knows of this?

422
00:33:22,750 --> 00:33:24,043
‎No one besides Mal-ttong…

423
00:33:27,505 --> 00:33:28,840
‎In truth,

424
00:33:29,966 --> 00:33:32,468
‎Lord Cho Won knows a little of it as well.

425
00:33:37,557 --> 00:33:38,558
‎Oh, dear!

426
00:33:44,022 --> 00:33:45,189
‎Go to him.

427
00:33:45,732 --> 00:33:46,566
‎Pardon?

428
00:33:46,649 --> 00:33:48,317
‎Go and plead your case to him.

429
00:33:50,111 --> 00:33:51,779
‎He is a man who knows spring.

430
00:33:53,698 --> 00:33:56,159
‎If he hears your heartfelt plea,

431
00:33:57,035 --> 00:34:00,329
‎he shall surely turn a blind eye,
‎no matter his relation to my husband.

432
00:34:00,413 --> 00:34:04,333
‎Do you truly think so?

433
00:34:05,334 --> 00:34:06,502
‎Who knows?

434
00:34:07,587 --> 00:34:11,716
‎He may even become a bridge
‎between you and Young Master In-ho.

435
00:34:38,076 --> 00:34:39,202
‎My lord.

436
00:34:40,912 --> 00:34:44,415
‎Well, there is something I must tell you.

437
00:34:44,499 --> 00:34:45,333
‎Now?

438
00:34:46,542 --> 00:34:47,376
‎Yes.

439
00:34:51,339 --> 00:34:52,215
‎Very well.

440
00:35:03,476 --> 00:35:04,435
‎A favor, you say?

441
00:35:05,895 --> 00:35:08,189
‎Then this may take some time.

442
00:35:10,817 --> 00:35:11,734
‎Would it be wise

443
00:35:12,568 --> 00:35:14,695
‎to leave your shoes outside so plainly?

444
00:35:15,696 --> 00:35:16,572
‎Huh?

445
00:35:20,201 --> 00:35:21,160
‎What I mean is,

446
00:35:23,121 --> 00:35:27,208
‎should anyone see you here,
‎would that not pose a problem?

447
00:35:41,097 --> 00:35:42,098
‎My lord.

448
00:35:52,567 --> 00:35:54,402
‎The young master has learned

449
00:35:54,986 --> 00:35:56,696
‎that I am a concubine in this house.

450
00:35:56,779 --> 00:35:59,407
‎-You had hidden it from him?
‎-Not deliberately.

451
00:36:00,449 --> 00:36:01,325
‎In any case,

452
00:36:02,827 --> 00:36:06,497
‎what should I write
‎to earn his forgiveness?

453
00:36:07,582 --> 00:36:09,125
‎Well, you…

454
00:36:11,335 --> 00:36:13,671
‎You do resemble her somewhat.

455
00:36:14,380 --> 00:36:15,423
‎Whom?

456
00:36:20,303 --> 00:36:21,596
‎Someone I know.

457
00:36:22,388 --> 00:36:23,472
‎How shall I put it?

458
00:36:23,556 --> 00:36:25,474
‎A true master in such matters, perhaps?

459
00:36:27,185 --> 00:36:28,019
‎A true master?

460
00:36:32,857 --> 00:36:34,233
‎"How could you…

461
00:36:36,903 --> 00:36:40,156
‎leave after merely brushing my shoulder?"

462
00:36:44,493 --> 00:36:47,747
‎"Thoughts of you leave me breathless…

463
00:36:49,832 --> 00:36:51,417
‎and I spent the night

464
00:36:52,960 --> 00:36:54,420
‎thoroughly drenched."

465
00:36:55,004 --> 00:36:56,214
‎"Breath…"

466
00:36:57,215 --> 00:36:58,633
‎My lord.

467
00:37:01,594 --> 00:37:03,930
‎How does one write "breathless"?

468
00:37:05,056 --> 00:37:07,516
‎Is there an "E" after "T-H"?

469
00:37:15,733 --> 00:37:16,734
‎Good.

470
00:37:21,822 --> 00:37:23,199
‎You are writing it correctly.

471
00:37:33,251 --> 00:37:35,670
‎"My thighs seem to part
‎of their own accord…

472
00:37:40,258 --> 00:37:44,053
‎yet there are no great hands
‎to spread them further."

473
00:37:47,932 --> 00:37:48,849
‎"Tonight…

474
00:37:53,062 --> 00:37:55,231
‎I long for you, Young Master."

475
00:38:09,495 --> 00:38:10,913
‎"When next we meet…

476
00:38:16,377 --> 00:38:18,963
‎scold this drenched little thing of mine."

477
00:38:28,014 --> 00:38:29,640
‎"I beg of you."

478
00:39:01,881 --> 00:39:02,757
‎Now…

479
00:39:05,343 --> 00:39:06,844
‎what will you do next?

480
00:39:10,264 --> 00:39:13,059
‎Pretend I am Young Master In-ho
‎and show me.

481
00:39:14,393 --> 00:39:18,105
‎What must be done to soothe his anger?

482
00:39:53,349 --> 00:39:54,392
‎Young Master.

483
00:40:05,861 --> 00:40:07,321
‎It is I, So-ok.

484
00:40:09,782 --> 00:40:10,741
‎Young Master.

485
00:40:14,995 --> 00:40:15,996
‎Young…

486
00:40:16,831 --> 00:40:17,665
‎Wait.

487
00:40:19,041 --> 00:40:21,043
‎Do not go, Young Master!

488
00:40:24,255 --> 00:40:25,423
‎Miss!

489
00:40:26,757 --> 00:40:27,883
‎What…

490
00:40:29,760 --> 00:40:32,888
‎-What manner of madness is this?
‎-It is I, So-ok.

491
00:40:33,389 --> 00:40:35,433
‎-So-ok.
‎-A concubine?

492
00:40:39,562 --> 00:40:41,856
‎From the day I could no longer see you,

493
00:40:43,315 --> 00:40:46,777
‎I have not slept a wink
‎for thoughts of you.

494
00:40:48,779 --> 00:40:49,613
‎Miss.

495
00:40:53,492 --> 00:40:56,412
‎There is not
‎a shred of falsehood in those words,

496
00:40:57,371 --> 00:40:58,372
‎is there?

497
00:41:21,270 --> 00:41:22,438
‎I have been the same.

498
00:41:23,397 --> 00:41:24,732
‎I too

499
00:41:31,530 --> 00:41:33,199
‎have spent…

500
00:41:35,910 --> 00:41:38,078
‎sleepless nights in agony,

501
00:41:38,162 --> 00:41:40,623
‎my heart torn apart by thoughts of you.

502
00:42:28,003 --> 00:42:30,339
‎This night of ours…

503
00:42:32,967 --> 00:42:34,927
‎that we tucked away…

504
00:42:37,721 --> 00:42:39,056
‎in such longing…

505
00:42:41,559 --> 00:42:44,186
‎I wish to unfold it here and now.

506
00:42:47,648 --> 00:42:49,483
‎Then do so, Young Master.

507
00:42:52,653 --> 00:42:54,613
‎Unfold it as you please.

508
00:42:56,574 --> 00:42:58,033
‎I wish for it too.

509
00:43:13,882 --> 00:43:15,092
‎Good.

510
00:43:16,510 --> 00:43:19,096
‎We are nearly there now, Miss.

511
00:43:22,016 --> 00:43:22,975
‎Young Master.

512
00:43:24,310 --> 00:43:26,103
‎The Young Master In-ho you longed for

513
00:43:27,062 --> 00:43:28,314
‎is here before you.

514
00:43:31,483 --> 00:43:33,110
‎It is I, So-ok.

515
00:43:45,456 --> 00:43:46,665
‎Miss.

516
00:43:51,337 --> 00:43:52,338
‎There.

517
00:44:11,148 --> 00:44:12,107
‎Your hand.

518
00:44:15,069 --> 00:44:15,903
‎Yes.

519
00:44:17,112 --> 00:44:20,157
‎I wish for it too, Young Master.

520
00:44:21,116 --> 00:44:22,743
‎Yes, Miss.

521
00:44:24,620 --> 00:44:25,788
‎Young Master.

522
00:44:33,962 --> 00:44:34,797
‎Wait…

523
00:44:39,051 --> 00:44:40,010
‎Well…

524
00:44:47,142 --> 00:44:50,104
‎Regarding that flower bud
‎you sent me last night.

525
00:44:50,187 --> 00:44:53,440
‎Before I could even lay a hand upon her,
‎she was already baring herself.

526
00:44:53,524 --> 00:44:54,858
‎I nearly lost my senses

527
00:44:54,942 --> 00:44:57,528
‎-and let the matter end too easily.
‎-It is So-ok, my lady.

528
00:44:58,237 --> 00:44:59,488
‎But you know me.

529
00:45:00,155 --> 00:45:02,449
‎If I were simply to grant you
‎what you desire,

530
00:45:03,117 --> 00:45:06,245
‎our wager would become rather pointless.

531
00:45:06,328 --> 00:45:07,871
‎So I barely managed to send her away.

532
00:45:09,415 --> 00:45:11,041
‎Did you sleep well through the night?

533
00:45:11,125 --> 00:45:13,752
‎I shall now devote myself
‎to my true objective,

534
00:45:13,836 --> 00:45:15,879
‎conquering the widow.

535
00:45:17,047 --> 00:45:18,298
‎Watch and see.

536
00:45:18,799 --> 00:45:21,260
‎I shall claim without fail
‎the reward you promised me,

537
00:45:21,343 --> 00:45:23,387
‎the one I could never refuse.

538
00:45:25,639 --> 00:45:26,515
‎Let me see that.

539
00:45:32,980 --> 00:45:33,981
‎Oh, here.

540
00:45:35,524 --> 00:45:39,027
‎LIQUOR

541
00:45:45,200 --> 00:45:49,204
‎"It was only for idle amusement…"

542
00:45:51,582 --> 00:45:53,542
‎What took you so long?

543
00:45:53,625 --> 00:45:57,087
‎You rascal,
‎since when have you ever waited for me?

544
00:45:57,671 --> 00:46:00,299
‎Here. Take this to the lady.

545
00:46:00,382 --> 00:46:02,676
‎She has left,
‎and she took Eun-sil with her.

546
00:46:05,304 --> 00:46:07,222
‎I hear she's gone
‎to her family home in Hwaseong.

547
00:46:07,306 --> 00:46:08,932
‎I wonder what happened all of a sudden.

548
00:46:36,793 --> 00:46:37,794
‎Last night,

549
00:46:39,421 --> 00:46:42,549
‎your late father appeared in my dream.

550
00:46:43,967 --> 00:46:45,344
‎He held my hand tightly

551
00:46:47,221 --> 00:46:50,307
‎and said he wished to see you.

552
00:47:22,172 --> 00:47:23,298
‎I suppose

553
00:47:24,174 --> 00:47:26,385
‎he longs for you dearly from there.

554
00:47:31,557 --> 00:47:33,809
‎Go pay a visit to your family home.

555
00:49:25,087 --> 00:49:26,755
‎Eun-sil!

556
00:49:28,882 --> 00:49:29,841
‎Eun-sil!

557
00:49:32,427 --> 00:49:33,261
‎Eun-sil!

558
00:49:36,598 --> 00:49:38,433
‎My lady!

559
00:49:39,559 --> 00:49:41,144
‎My lady!

560
00:49:42,771 --> 00:49:43,897
‎The lord has come.

561
00:49:45,148 --> 00:49:46,274
‎The lord!

562
00:49:47,109 --> 00:49:48,985
‎Lord Cho Won has come all the way here.

563
00:49:54,199 --> 00:49:55,409
‎My lady.

564
00:50:17,723 --> 00:50:20,267
‎Oh, all right.

565
00:50:20,851 --> 00:50:22,644
‎What? Come now.

566
00:50:22,728 --> 00:50:23,895
‎Why, you…

567
00:50:24,563 --> 00:50:25,439
‎Oh, there she is.

568
00:50:30,444 --> 00:50:31,570
‎Well…

569
00:50:32,362 --> 00:50:35,073
‎Did you tell the lady I was here?

570
00:50:35,782 --> 00:50:36,616
‎Yes.

571
00:50:36,700 --> 00:50:40,120
‎Right, and what did she say?

572
00:50:40,203 --> 00:50:41,913
‎She said
‎she never wishes to see you again,

573
00:50:43,081 --> 00:50:44,916
‎so you are to leave.

574
00:50:45,000 --> 00:50:46,460
‎Well, that's…

575
00:50:47,669 --> 00:50:48,545
‎No, that…

576
00:50:50,380 --> 00:50:51,298
‎That cannot be right.

577
00:50:52,966 --> 00:50:54,718
‎It cannot.

578
00:50:57,012 --> 00:50:58,013
‎Go bring her.

579
00:50:58,096 --> 00:50:59,556
‎Go and tell her this.

580
00:51:01,641 --> 00:51:03,310
‎Until she agrees to see me,

581
00:51:03,977 --> 00:51:04,853
‎I shall not

582
00:51:06,021 --> 00:51:08,190
‎take a single step from this place!

583
00:51:08,273 --> 00:51:10,275
‎She chose to leave me without a word,

584
00:51:10,358 --> 00:51:11,568
‎so I too shall do as I please

585
00:51:12,778 --> 00:51:14,029
‎and wait for her here.

586
00:51:14,613 --> 00:51:16,448
‎Repeat every word exactly as I said it.

587
00:51:16,531 --> 00:51:18,950
‎My lord, please stop this and go at once.

588
00:51:19,034 --> 00:51:22,621
‎What if an elder of her family sees you?

589
00:51:22,704 --> 00:51:23,789
‎Forgive me.

590
00:51:27,751 --> 00:51:29,836
‎Hey! Go deliver my words at once!

591
00:52:12,546 --> 00:52:16,174
‎If you mean to go on like this,
‎you may as well go see the lord outside.

592
00:52:20,345 --> 00:52:22,097
‎He still has not left.

593
00:52:24,015 --> 00:52:26,226
‎He may well freeze to death
‎out there in the rain soon.

594
00:52:40,907 --> 00:52:43,285
‎Go back in! Go!

595
00:52:43,368 --> 00:52:45,412
‎Go! Quickly!

596
00:52:54,588 --> 00:52:56,256
‎Why did that scoundrel Cho Won

597
00:52:56,756 --> 00:53:01,011
‎have you write a letter
‎to explain that earlier one?

598
00:53:01,678 --> 00:53:02,846
‎That is what I'm asking.

599
00:53:02,929 --> 00:53:05,682
‎Mother, I tell you. I truly know nothing.

600
00:53:06,516 --> 00:53:09,519
‎Lord Cho Won glared at me
‎as though he would kill me

601
00:53:09,603 --> 00:53:11,271
‎and said if I did not write it at once,

602
00:53:11,354 --> 00:53:13,356
‎he would bring great disgrace
‎upon this household.

603
00:53:14,524 --> 00:53:19,112
‎I only feared some misfortune
‎might come upon you, Mother.

604
00:53:20,447 --> 00:53:22,324
‎That is why I did as he commanded.

605
00:53:23,450 --> 00:53:25,243
‎Think on it, Mother.

606
00:53:25,785 --> 00:53:28,413
‎He is a nobleman. To a girl like me…

607
00:53:29,414 --> 00:53:32,626
‎Yes, just as you always say,

608
00:53:32,709 --> 00:53:35,170
‎a completely witless girl.

609
00:53:36,588 --> 00:53:37,923
‎For heaven's sake.

610
00:53:38,006 --> 00:53:39,799
‎Why would he explain his reasons to me?

611
00:53:41,509 --> 00:53:44,262
‎I only did as I was told, Mother!

612
00:53:44,346 --> 00:53:45,722
‎Please believe me!

613
00:53:49,059 --> 00:53:50,518
‎Go pay So-ok a visit.

614
00:53:52,062 --> 00:53:53,521
‎So-ok? Why?

615
00:53:54,189 --> 00:53:56,691
‎That is Cho Won's cousin's house,

616
00:53:56,775 --> 00:53:59,736
‎so go there
‎and listen for anything you can.

617
00:53:59,819 --> 00:54:01,613
‎I must know why that man

618
00:54:01,696 --> 00:54:04,157
‎had you do such a thing!

619
00:54:06,284 --> 00:54:08,078
‎Even for but a moment,

620
00:54:09,829 --> 00:54:12,582
‎would you let me see your face?

621
00:54:15,502 --> 00:54:17,003
‎I shall wait here!

622
00:54:39,192 --> 00:54:40,860
‎My heart is here with you…

623
00:54:45,073 --> 00:54:46,616
‎yet I cannot show it.

624
00:55:04,843 --> 00:55:06,302
‎Hey, Chil-seong!

625
00:55:06,386 --> 00:55:07,220
‎The letter!

626
00:55:13,643 --> 00:55:14,561
‎Eun-sil.

627
00:55:16,479 --> 00:55:17,480
‎Where is the lady?

628
00:55:34,581 --> 00:55:35,874
‎The night grows cold.

629
00:55:38,626 --> 00:55:40,545
‎You should return now, my lord.

630
00:55:47,093 --> 00:55:48,386
‎Are you all right?

631
00:55:53,349 --> 00:55:56,853
‎Will you accept this letter?

632
00:56:02,650 --> 00:56:05,403
‎That is all I ask.

633
00:56:07,655 --> 00:56:08,865
‎Within this letter…

634
00:56:11,743 --> 00:56:13,286
‎lies my true heart.

635
00:56:15,288 --> 00:56:17,665
‎It is proof that my feelings
‎are no falsehood.

636
00:56:19,542 --> 00:56:22,879
‎I… I cannot leave like this.

637
00:56:24,964 --> 00:56:26,883
‎I wish to clear away
‎your misunderstanding of me.

638
00:56:27,383 --> 00:56:28,510
‎So please…

639
00:56:30,303 --> 00:56:32,097
‎Oh, please,

640
00:56:33,556 --> 00:56:35,433
‎will you accept this letter?

641
00:56:47,195 --> 00:56:48,988
‎I believed your heart answered mine.

642
00:56:51,908 --> 00:56:53,034
‎Your heart and mine

643
00:56:54,953 --> 00:56:57,664
‎both desire one another, do they not?

644
00:56:58,164 --> 00:56:59,040
‎And yet,

645
00:56:59,791 --> 00:57:01,793
‎you will not let me do anything.

646
00:57:01,876 --> 00:57:03,503
‎What am I to do?

647
00:57:08,174 --> 00:57:09,092
‎Why…

648
00:57:12,387 --> 00:57:14,597
‎Why did you appear before me?

649
00:57:16,266 --> 00:57:19,769
‎Why appear before this wretched creature
‎who would otherwise have lived peacefully…

650
00:57:22,856 --> 00:57:23,940
‎only to leave me…

651
00:57:26,693 --> 00:57:28,278
‎longing for you so?

652
00:58:00,643 --> 00:58:01,644
‎I…

653
00:58:06,941 --> 00:58:09,194
‎wish to live, my lord.

654
00:58:32,926 --> 00:58:33,760
‎Then I…

655
00:58:37,972 --> 00:58:39,140
‎I shall…

656
00:58:43,311 --> 00:58:44,479
‎save you.

657
00:58:48,566 --> 00:58:49,484
‎I shall save you…

658
00:58:53,112 --> 00:58:54,405
‎no matter what.

659
01:02:33,166 --> 01:02:38,171
‎Subtitle translation by: Yoonjung Song
